{
  "voice": "成人男声｜老师清晰",
  "reference": "/Users/zhaozixu/Documents/Codex/2026-06-04/new-chat/work/full_voice_catalog/12-adult-male-teacher-clear.wav",
  "cfg_value": 1.35,
  "inference_timesteps": 12,
  "normalize": false,
  "sentence_method": "one complete sentence per generation",
  "word_method": "independent word generation, not extracted from sentence audio",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "The world's best athletes get together for the Olympic Games every four years.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-01.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The 2024 Olympic Games took place in Paris, France.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-02.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "For the first time, people watched breaking as a new event at the Olympics.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-03.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Breaking is also called break dancing.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-04.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "It is popular among the youth today.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-05.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The high-energy, skillful dance includes moves such as Top Rock, Footwork, Go Down, Freeze and so on.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-06.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "The dancers need to think and show the moves of the hands and feet quickly.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-07.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "Break dance battles are a common way to find out who is the best dancer.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-08.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "In the 1970s in New York City, fighting with others among teenage girls and boys became more and more serious.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-09.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "Some of them began to deal with the problem through dance instead.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-10.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "Just then, the dance style first showed up on the streets.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-11.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "In a \"battle\" like this, one dancer will show off his kicks and spins, and then the next will continue to compete.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-12.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "Everyone keeps their spirits up.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-13.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "The best dancer will finally be picked out and gain his grand victory.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-14.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "Today, there are battles held in a local hall, where dancers are scored and voted for based on their performance.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-15.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "The planners added breaking to the Olympics, because it meets the standard of being widely practised by men and women in a large number of countries.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-16.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "text": "\"Breaking has been accepted as a sport. I really feel proud,\" said Xiaoyu, one breakdancer.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-17.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "text": "\"And for the Olympics, it will get more attention from young people who may not follow some of the traditional sports.\"",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-18.mp3",
      "exists": true
    }
  ],
